{"id":"vod_jy_116507","vodId":"116507","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"神曲奏界Polyphonica","name_cn":"神曲奏界Polyphonica","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集完结","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/a8b04bd7936853746c88756856a2524d.jpg"},"summary":"POLYPHONICA是一个被称为“精灵”的生命也存在的异世界。与地球上存在的世界同属于平行世界，从地球被POLYPHONICA大陆传唤的人类也在这个世界生活。POLYPHONICA大陆的科学水平是地球的现代～近未来的水准，与地球现代科学产物同样的东西也基本存在以外，所谓的未来城市也一样存在。与之平行的是，借助演奏“神曲”的精灵力量这样的技术体系也同时发展着。似乎在这个世界隐藏着极大的秘密，精灵和人类不知不觉就面临着真相揭晓的那个时候……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-07-29 19:12:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bqxl110a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/azp7kkZd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eER0wjYa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/axk2g33e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkRr1EEa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e73pR4re/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bqxl1NGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/eER0wnva/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2j1wja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/axk2gJ9e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJn0lYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集完结","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dNkYJz6e/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:57:38.529Z"}